	DCA SUBL3
	TAD DCTRLW	/RESTORE DEVICE CONTROL WORD
	DCA I SUBL3
	DCA DIRKEY	/ERASE OLD BLOCK IN USR
	IAC		/GET LENGTH OF THIS SUB-FILE
	TAD FCOUNT
	DCA SUBL3
	TAD I (7600
	JMS I (FAKUSR
	JMS I (200
	  4		/CLOSE THIS FILE
	  SNAME
SUBL3,	  0
	JMP I (CLOERR
	JMS I (UNFAK
